What is vestibular physiotherapy?
Vestibular and balance physiotherapy assesses and treats dizziness, vertigo and balance problems. It uses simple exercises and movement strategies to help your brain make sense of signals from your inner ear, eyes and body so you feel steadier and more confident when you move.

